plicate a number\n• Convert an accepted estimate into an invoice in one tap\n• Track status: Draft, Sent, Accepted, Rejected, Expired, Void, Paid, Unpaid\n• Recurring invoices — weekly, monthly, or yearly\n• Automatic subtotal, tax, and total calculation\n\n**16 PROFESSIONAL PDF TEMPLATES**\nChoose a style that fits your trade — Modern, Contractor, Repair Shop, Consultant, Field Service, Studio, Executive, Retail, Wellness, and more. Your logo, signature, and payment details carry over automatically.\n\n**ADD YOUR OWN PAYMENT DETAILS**\nNabixSoft Invoice doesn't process payments. Add the payment information your customers already use:\n• E-transfer email address\n• A payment link you provide\n• A QR code generated from your link, printed on the invoice\n• A payment note for cheques, cash, or anything else\n\n**CUSTOMERS, CATALOG & EXPENSES**\n• Save customer details — search, sort, and filter anytime\n• Generate paid/unpaid customer statements\n• Build a catalog of products and services, with starter items included\n• Track expenses by vendor, category, and receipt photo\n\n**KNOW YOUR NUMBERS**\n• Dashboard totals for sales, unpaid, paid, expenses, and net profit\n• Sales-by-status and expenses-by-category charts\n• Monthly trend view\n• Search across invoices, estimates, customers, items, and expenses\n\n**OFFLINE-FIRST & PRIVATE**\nNo account, no login, no server. Your business profile, customers, documents, and expenses are stored locally on your device. Export a full backup anytime, including a year-end export, and restore it on a new device.\n\n**BUILT IN CANADA**\n• English and Canadian French interface\n• Bill in CAD or USD\n• Set your own tax name and rate\n\n**EVERYDAY DETAILS**\n• Print, share, or email any PDF from the app\n• Business logo and signature on every document\n• In-app support and FAQs\n\nNabixSoft Invoice is built for tradespeople, freelancers, and small service businesses who want to look professional and get paid — without ongoing fees.\n\